  ('p-o-positiv-meno-menopause-gummies', 'O Positiv MENO Menopause Gummies', 'O Positiv', 'menopause', 'physical', 'MENO gummies are a daily menopause supplement for multi-symptom relief. O Positiv recommends them for women with hot flashes, night sweats, occasional sleeplessness, occasional anxiousness and mood swings.', '$41.99 one-time for 1 bottle (30 servings, 2 gummies each, one-month supply); $34.99/bottle with monthly delivery (brand page, Nov 2026)', null, 'https://opositiv.com/products/meno-menopause-vitamin-capsule', '["menopause","hormone-free","non-hormonal","herbal","sleep","stress","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["menopause","sleep","mental-health"]'::jsonb, '["O Positiv"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","materials":"Per 2 gummies: Vitamin D (cholecalciferol) 15 mcg; Vitamin B6 (pyridoxine HCl) 2 mg; Sodium 10 mg; Ashwagandha KSM-66 (Withania somnifera root) 150 mg; Black Cohosh extract (Actaea racemosa root) 40 mg; Chasteberry extract (Vitex agnus-castus fruit) 40 mg. Other ingredients: organic tapioca syrup, organic cane sugar, water; less than 2% of carnauba wax, citric acid, coconut oil, fruit and vegetable juice (for color), natural flavor, pectin, sodium citrate.","allergens":"No allergen statement on page. Contains coconut oil and organic cane sugar.","sideEffects":"Do not use MENO if you are pregnant or nursing. Consult your physician before taking if you have a medical condition, are taking any medications and/or any type of hormone therapy (including birth control pills). Do not use if cap seal is broken or missing. Keep out of reach of children."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are O Positiv''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"O Positiv":"https://opositiv.com/products/meno-menopause-vitamin-capsule"},"warnings":["Do not use