  ('p-biolae-meno-essential', 'Biolae Meno Essential', 'Biolae', 'menopause', 'physical', 'Meno Essential is a once-daily plant-based capsule for women with perimenopause or menopause symptoms. Each capsule has 100 mg of SheVari4 Shatavari root extract. The page says the extract has been studied for hot flushes, sleep, mood and fatigue.', 'A$48 one-time; A$39/month on monthly plan; A$105 per 3-month supply (brand page, Nov 2026). Capsule count not stated.', 'https://www.biolae.com.au/cdn/shop/files/Meno_Essential_-_1_ef28d73c-8783-4266-ab61-137348990b70.jpg?v=1791860563', 'https://www.biolae.com.au/products/meno-essential', '["menopause","perimenopause","supplement","herbal","hormone-free","sleep","fatigue"]'::jsonb, '["menopause","perimenopause","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Biolae"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements). Sold in Australia; the page says it is TGA-listed (no AUST L number shown; not verified).","materials":"Per capsule: Asparagus Racemosus (Shatavari) root dry conc ext. (SheVari4) 100mg, equiv. to Asparagus Racemosus peeled root dry 2g. Excipients not listed on page.","allergens":"Page states: No hormones, parabens, soy, or gluten. No dairy or other allergen statement.","sideEffects":"Speak with your healthcare professional if you are pregnant or breastfeeding, have a history of oestrogen-dependent conditions, or take other medications (including HRT). Always read the label and follow the directions for use. If symptoms persist, talk to your health professional. Vitamin and mineral supplements should not replace a balanced diet. Store below 25C in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Do not use if tamper seal is broken."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Biolae''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Biolae":"https://www.biolae.com.au/products/meno-essential"},"warnings":["Speak with your healthcare professional if you are pregnant or breastfeeding, have a history of oestrogen-dependent conditions, or take other medications (including HRT).","Always read the label and follow the directions for use. If symptoms persist, talk to your health professional.","Vitamin and mineral supplements should not replace a balanced diet.","Store below 25C in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Do not use if tamper seal is broken."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.biolae.com.au/products/meno-essential","what":"Product page: price, active ingredient line, directions, warnings, free-from line, image"}],"ingredients":"Per capsule: Asparagus Racemosus (Shatavari) root dry conc ext. (SheVari4) 100mg, equiv. to Asparagus Racemosus peeled root dry 2g. Excipients not listed on page.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Biolae''s product page:","steps":["Take 1 capsule daily at bedtime."],"sourceUrl":"https://www.biolae.com.au/products/meno-essential","sourceLabel":"Biolae: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: One-time purchase, Monthly plan, 3-month plan.","hiddenReason":"Not every fact is sourced yet: Capsule count / days per bottle not on page; Excipients (other ingredients) not on page; No dairy or full allergen statement; AUST L number not shown; TGA listing per brand only"}'::jsonb),
  ('p-perelel-perimenopause-support-pack', 'Perelel Perimenopause Support Pack', 'Perelel', 'menopause', 'physical', 'A daily vitamin pack for women in perimenopause, from the first hormonal changes until 12 months after the last period. Each pack has a multivitamin, a metabolic support capsule, a perimenopause complex and an omega-3 softgel. The page says it targets stress, mood, heart, brain and bone health.', '$69.35 one-time or $58.95/month subscription for 30 daily packs (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://perelelhealth.com/cdn/shop/files/PerimenopauseSupportPack_MainImage.png?v=1793585227', 'https://perelelhealth.com/products/peri-support-pack', '["perimenopause","menopause","supplement","stress","hormone-support"]'::jsonb, '["perimenopause","supplement","bone-health"]'::jsonb, '["Perelel"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","materials":"Perimenopause Multivitamin (2 capsules): Vitamin A (as beta carotene) 900 mcg RAE (100%); Vitamin C (as ascorbic acid) 50 mg (56%); Vitamin D (as cholecalciferol) 100 mcg (4000 IU) (500%); Vitamin E (as d-alpha tocopherol) 15 mg (100%); Thiamin (as thiamin hydrochloride) 2 mg (167%); Riboflavin (as riboflavin 5''-phosphate) 2 mg (154%); Niacin (as niacinamide) 14 mg NE (88%); Vitamin B6 (as pyridoxal 5''-phosphate) 3 mg (176%); Folate (as L-5-methyltetrahydrofolate calcium) 1000 mcg DFE (250%); Vitamin B12 (as methylcobalamin) 12 mcg (500%); Biotin 30 mcg (100%); Pantothenic Acid (as d-calcium pantothenate) 10 mg (200%); Choline (as choline bitartrate, VitaCholine) 25 mg (5%); Iodine (as potassium iodide) 150 mcg (100%); Magnesium (as magnesium bisglycinate chelate) 25 mg (6%); Zinc (as zinc bisglycinate chelate) 15 mg (136%); Selenium (as L-selenomethionine) 55 mcg (100%); Copper (as copper bisglycinate chelate) 0.9 mg (100%); Chromium (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate) 20 mcg (57%); L-Theanine 100 mg (**); Coenzyme Q10 (ubiquinone) 25 mg (**); B