 if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications.","Contains fish.","These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/peri-support-pack","what":"Brand product page: price, pack contents, Supplement Facts for all 4 pills, allergen line, directions, warnings, image"}],"ingredients":"Perimenopause Multivitamin (2 capsules): Vitamin A (as beta carotene) 900 mcg RAE (100%); Vitamin C (as ascorbic acid) 50 mg (56%); Vitamin D (as cholecalciferol) 100 mcg (4000 IU) (500%); Vitamin E (as d-alpha tocopherol) 15 mg (100%); Thiamin (as thiamin hydrochloride) 2 mg (167%); Riboflavin (as riboflavin 5''-phosphate) 2 mg (154%); Niacin (as niacinamide) 14 mg NE (88%); Vitamin B6 (as pyridoxal 5''-phosphate) 3 mg (176%); Folate (as L-5-methyltetrahydrofolate calcium) 1000 mcg DFE (250%); Vitamin B12 (as methylcobalamin) 12 mcg (500%); Biotin 30 mcg (100%); Pantothenic Acid (as d-calcium pantothenate) 10 mg (200%); Choline (as choline bitartrate, VitaCholine) 25 mg (5%); Iodine (as potassium iodide) 150 mcg (100%); Magnesium (as magnesium bisglycinate chelate) 25 mg (6%); Zinc (as zinc bisglycinate chelate) 15 mg (136%); Selenium (as L-selenomethionine) 55 mcg (100%); Copper (as copper bisglycinate chelate) 0.9 mg (100%); Chromium (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate) 20 mcg (57%); L-Theanine 100 mg (**); Coenzyme Q10 (ubiquinone) 25 mg (**); Boron (as boronganic glycine, as printed) 1 mg (**); Vitamin K2 (as menaquinone-7) 30 mcg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), L-leucine. | Metabolic Support (1 capsule): L-Carnitine L-Tartrate 100 mg (**); Green Tea Leaf Extract 50 mg (**); Berberine HCl 50 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), rice extract blend, L-leucine. | Perimenopause Complex (1 capsule): Ashwagandha Root and Leaf Extract (Sensoril) 125 mg (**); DIM (3,3''-Diindolylmethane) 60 mg (**); Rhubarb Root Extract 4 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), rice extract blend, L-leucine. | Omega DHA + EPA (1 softgel): Calories 10; Total Fat 1 g (1%*); Polyunsaturated Fat 1 g (**); Cholesterol <5 mg (1%); Fish Oil 500 mg (**); Total Omega-3 Fatty Acids 375 mg (**); DHA 250 mg (**); EPA 100 mg (**); Other Fatty Acids 25 mg (**). Other ingredients: Purified fish oil in natural triglyceride form with mixed natural tocopherols, gelatin, glycerin, purified water, natural lemon oil. Contains: Fish (wild caught anchovies and sardines). | ** Daily Value not established.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Perelel''s product page:","steps":["Take one pack daily with food and a full glass of water."],"sourceUrl":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/peri-support-pack","sourceLabel":"Perelel: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: One-time purchase (30 packs), Subscribe & Save monthly."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-perelel-hormonal-balance-support', 'Perelel Hormonal Balance Support', 'Perelel', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A daily capsule with a 40:1 myo-inositol to D-chiro-inositol ratio plus berberine, alpha lipoic acid and DIM. The page calls it nutritional support for PCOS and lists irregular cycles, insulin issues and hormonal acne as who it is for. It says to stop at a positive pregnancy test and to avoid it while breastfeeding.', '$55.24 one-time or $46.95 subscription for a 30 day supply (120 capsules) (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://perelelhealth.com/cdn/shop/files/HormonalBalanceSupport_MainImage.png?v=1793587864', 'https://perelelhealth.com/products/hormonal-balance-support', '["pcos","irregular","hormone-support","acne","supplement","fertility","safety-concern"]'::jsonb, '["supplement","fertility"]'::jsonb, '["Perelel"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","sideEffects":"Stop upon a positive pregnancy test. Avoid while breastfeeding (berberine). Lowering glucose may cause mild headaches; ramp up the dose slowly. As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Perelel''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Perelel":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/hormonal-balance-support"},"warnings":["Stop upon a positive pregnancy test.","Avoid while breastfeeding (berberine).","Lowering glucose may cause mild headaches; ramp up the dose slowly.","As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any m