  ('p-perelel-conception-support-pack', 'Perelel Conception Support Pack', 'Perelel', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A daily pack for women planning or trying to conceive, with a prenatal multivitamin, a CoQ10 + folate capsule and an omega-3 softgel. The page suggests starting 6 to 12 months before trying. It pairs with Fertility+ Support, a separate product.', '$58.77 one-time or $49.95/month subscription for 30 daily packs (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://perelelhealth.com/cdn/shop/files/ConceptionSupportPack_MainImage.png?v=1793145735', 'https://perelelhealth.com/products/conception-support-pack', '["fertility","pregnancy","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["fertility","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Perelel"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","allergens":"Contains: Fish (wild caught anchovies and sardines), in the Omega DHA + EPA softgel. No gluten/dairy/soy free-of statement on this page.","sideEffects":"As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications. Contains fish. Contains iron (16 mg). No accidental iron overdose / keep-out-of-reach-of-children warning shown on the brand page even though the product contains iron; check the physical label. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Perelel''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Perelel":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/conception-support-pack"},"warnings":["As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications.","Contains fish.","Contains iron (16 mg). No accidental iron overdose / k