  ('p-perelel-fertility-support', 'Perelel Fertility+ Support', 'Perelel', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A daily antioxidant capsule with NAC, acai and CoQ10 for people trying to conceive who want extra support. The page says it was formulated by fertility doctors to support egg health and is meant for women and men.', '$47.00 one-time or $39.95 subscription for 60 capsules (30 days) (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://perelelhealth.com/cdn/shop/files/Fertility_Support_MainImage.png?v=1793587855', 'https://perelelhealth.com/products/fertility-support', '["fertility","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["fertility","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Perelel"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","sideEffects":"As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Perelel''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Perelel":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/fertility-support"},"warnings":["As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications.","These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/fertility-support","what":"Brand product page: price, Supplement Facts, directions, warnings