1 mg (**). Other ingredients: HPMC delayed-release capsule, plant cellulose, peppermint leaf powder. Contains less than 2% of: rice extract blend, L-leucine. | Cognitive Support Blend (1 capsule): L-Theanine 50 mg (**); Lutein (from Marigold Flower extract, Lute-gen) 10 mg (**); Zeaxanthin (from Marigold Flower extract, Lute-gen) 2 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), silica, plant cellulose. | Beauty Blend (1 capsule): Biotin 30 mcg (86%); Hydrolyzed Bovine Collagen Peptides 500 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), plant cellulose. | Omega DHA + EPA (1 softgel): Calories 10; Total Fat 1 g (1%*); Polyunsaturated Fat 1 g (**); Cholesterol <5 mg (1%); Fish Oil 500 mg (**); Total Omega-3 Fatty Acids 375 mg (**); DHA 250 mg (**); EPA 100 mg (**); Other Fatty Acids 25 mg (**). Other ingredients: Purified fish oil in natural triglyceride form with mixed natural tocopherols, gelatin, glycerin, purified water, natural lemon oil. Contains: Fish (wild caught anchovies and sardines). | %DV is for pregnant and lactating women. ** Daily Value not established.","allergens":"Contains: Fish (wild caught anchovies and sardines). Also contains bovine collagen (not vegetarian). No free-of statement on this page.","sideEffects":"As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications. Contains fish. Contains iron (16 mg). No accidental iron overdose / keep-out-of-reach-of-children warning shown on the brand page even though the product contains iron; check the physical label. For postpartum struggles the page recommends consulting a physician or mental health professional. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Perelel''s own, from its product page