dide) 150 mcg (52%); Magnesium (as magnesium bisglycinate chelate) 30 mg (8%); Zinc (as zinc bisglycinate chelate) 11 mg (85%); Selenium (as L-selenomethionine) 50 mcg (71%); Copper (as copper bisglycinate chelate) 1 mg (77%); Chromium (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate) 30 mcg (67%); Vitamin K2 (as menaquinone-7) 30 mcg (**); Boron (as boronganic glycine, as printed) 1 mg (**). Other ingredients: HPMC delayed-release capsule, plant cellulose, peppermint leaf powder. Contains less than 2% of: rice extract blend, L-leucine. | Cognitive Support Blend (1 capsule): L-Theanine 50 mg (**); Lutein (from Marigold Flower extract, Lute-gen) 10 mg (**); Zeaxanthin (from Marigold Flower extract, Lute-gen) 2 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), silica, plant cellulose. | Beauty Blend (1 capsule): Biotin 30 mcg (86%); Hydrolyzed Bovine Collagen Peptides 500 mg (**). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), plant cellulose. | Omega DHA + EPA (1 softgel): Calories 10; Total Fat 1 g (1%*); Polyunsaturated Fat 1 g (**); Cholesterol <5 mg (1%); Fish Oil 500 mg (**); Total Omega-3 Fatty Acids 375 mg (**); DHA 250 mg (**); EPA 100 mg (**); Other Fatty Acids 25 mg (**). Other ingredients: Purified fish oil in natural triglyceride form with mixed natural tocopherols, gelatin, glycerin, purified water, natural lemon oil. Contains: Fish (wild caught anchovies and sardines). | %DV is for pregnant and lactating women. ** Daily Value not established.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Perelel''s product page:","steps":["Take one pack daily with food and a full glass of water."],"sourceUrl":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/mom-multi-support-pack","sourceLabel":"Perelel: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: One-time purchase, Subscribe & Save (every 30/45/60 days)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-perelel-daily-iron-ease', 'Perelel Daily Iron Ease', 'Perelel', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A once-daily iron capsule (15 mg iron as Ferrochel) with vitamin C, B12 and magnesium. The page lists heavier periods, iron deficiency or anemia, anemia in pregnancy and fatigue as who it is for. It is made to pair with a Perelel multivitamin pack.', '$29.35 one-time or $24.95 subscription for 30 capsules (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://perelelhealth.com/cdn/shop/files/DailyIronEase_MainImage.png?v=1793588217', 'https://perelelhealth.com/products/daily-iron-ease', '["anemia","fatigue","heavy-flow","pregnancy","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Perelel"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","sideEffects":"As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications. No accidental iron overdose / keep-out-of-reach-of-children warning shown on the brand page even though the product contains iron; check the physical label. If taken with a Perelel prenatal/postnatal pack (16 mg iron), total iron is 31 mg/day; the page does not address this. These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Perelel''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Perelel":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/daily-iron-ease"},"warnings":["As with any supplement, consult your doctor before use if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition or are taking any medications.","No accidental iron overdose / keep-out-of-reach-of-children warning shown on the brand page even though the product contains iron; check the physical label.","If taken with a Perelel prenatal/postnatal pack (16 mg iron), total iron is 31 mg/day; the page does not address this.","These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/daily-iron-ease","what":"Brand product page: price, Supplement Facts, directions, who it''s for, image"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 1 capsule. Vitamin C (as ascorbic acid) 30 mg (33%); Vitamin B12 (as methylcobalamin) 5 mcg (208%); Iron (as ferrous bisglycinate chelate, Ferrochel) 15 mg (83%); Magnesium (as magnesium citrate) 25 mg (6%). Other ingredients: Organic rice flour, vegetable cellulose (capsule), L-leucine, silica.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Perelel''s product page:","steps":["Take 1 capsule daily with food and water.","The FAQ recommends taking it with a full meal."],"sourceUrl":"https://perelelhealth.com/products/daily-iron-ease","sourceLabel":"Perelel: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: One-time purchase, Subscribe & Save (every 30/45/60 days)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-thorne-berberine', 'Thorne Berberine', 'Thorne', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A botanical capsule with berberine from Indian barberry plus a berberine phytosome. Thorne says it supports healthy cholesterol and blood sugar, GI microbial balance and metabolism. The page does not mention PCOS, and says not to use it if pregnant, nursing or trying to conceive.', '$44 for 60 capsules (30 servings) (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://d1vo8zfysxy97v.cloudfront.net/media/product/sf800__v88dfe2b0c4e10d4f1fc35d6b28a2cf7f05d0fb1d.webp', 'https://www.thorne.com/products/dp/berberine-500', '["supplement","herbal","safety-concern"]'::jsonb, '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Thorne"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","allergens":"Gluten free, dairy free, soy free (brand page). Contraindicated in anyone with a history of hypersensitivity to any of its ingredients.","sideEffects":"Do not use if pregnant, nursing, or trying to conceive. Decreases activity of CYP2D6, CYP2C9 and CYP3A4 enzymes (can affect how some medicines are processed). Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to any ingredient. FAQ: mild gas, nausea, diarrhea or constipation can occur, especially when starting."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Thorne''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Thorne":"https://www.thorne.com/products/dp/berberine-500"},"warnings":["Do not use if pregnant, nursing, or trying to conceive.","Decreases activity of CYP2D6, CYP2C9 and CYP3A4 enzymes (can affect how some medicines are processed).","Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to any ingredient.","FAQ: mild gas, nausea, diarrhea or constipation can occur, especially when starting."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.thorne.com/products/dp/berberine-500","what":"Thorne product page: price, Supplement Facts, warnings, suggested use, image"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 2 capsules. Berberine HCl (from Indian Barberry extract) (root) 450 mg; Berberine Phytosome 550 mg. Other ingredients: Calcium Laurate, Hypromellose (derived from cellulose) capsule.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Thorne''s product page:","steps":["Take 1-2 capsules two times daily with food or as recommended by your health-care practitioner."],"sourceUrl":"https://www.thorne.com/products/dp/berberine-500","sourceLabel":"Thorne: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: 30 servings (60 capsules), 60 servings (120 capsules)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-thorne-5-mthf-1-mg', 'Thorne 5-MTHF 1 mg', 'Thorne', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A one-capsule folate supplement in the active L-5-methyltetrahydrofolate form. Thorne says it suits people with MTHFR gene variants and lists fetal development among its uses. The label says to consult a practitioner if pregnant.', '$24 for 60 capsules (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://d1vo8zfysxy97v.cloudfront.net/media/product/b129__v76f30115cd7ab393b91e0245d6b233248b431e19.webp', 'https://thorne.com/products/dp/5-mthf-1-mg', '["supplement","pregnancy","fertility"]'::jsonb, '["supplement","fertility"]'::jsonb, '["Thorne"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","allergens":"Gluten free, dairy free, soy free (brand page). Contraindicated in anyone with a history of hypersensitivity to any of its ingredients.","sideEffects":"If pregnant, consult your health-care practitioner before use. Not recommended with methotrexate cancer therapy. Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to any ingredient."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Thorne''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Thorne":"https://thorne.com/products/dp/5-mthf-1-mg"},"warnings":["If pregnant, consult your health-care practitioner before use.","Not recommended with methotrexate cancer therapy.","Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to any ingredient."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://thorne.com/products/dp/5-mthf-1-mg","what":"Thorne product page: price, Supplement Facts, warnings, suggested use, image"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 1 capsule. Folate (as L-5-Methyltetrahydrofolate) 1.7 mg DFE. Other ingredients: Leucine, microcrystalline cellulose, silicon dioxide, hypromellose (derived from cellulose) capsule.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Thorne''s product page:","steps":["Take 1 capsule one to three times daily, or as recommended by your health-care practitioner."],"sourceUrl":"https://thorne.com/products/dp/5-mthf-1-mg","sourceLabel":"Thorne: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: 1 mg, 60 capsules, 1 mg, 90 capsules."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-seeking-health-dao-enzyme-formerly-histamine-dig', 'Seeking Health DAO Enzyme (formerly Histamine Digest / Histamine Block)', 'Seeking Health', 'gut-health', 'physical', 'A capsule of diamine oxidase (DAO), an enzyme that helps break down histamine from food. It is for people who react to high-histamine foods and drinks. The DAO comes from pork kidney, so it is not vegetarian or vegan.', '$40 for 30 capsules; $90 for 90 capsules (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://www.seekinghealth.com/cdn/shop/files/HIST-DIG-CAP_1_White_1200x1200.png?v=1775148942', 'https://www.seekinghealth.com/products/dao-enzyme', '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Seeking Health"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","materials":"Serving size: 1 capsule. DAOgest porcine kidney extract (Diamine Oxidase Activity 30,000 HDU) 4.2 mg. Other ingredients: microcrystalline cellulose, vegetarian capsule (hypromellose, water, and gellan gum), and ascorbyl palmitate. (Label text from Fullscript listing; brand page shows the panel only as an image and names DAOgest from porcine kidney.)","allergens":"Free of: Eggs, Fish, Gluten, GMO, Milk, Peanuts, Shellfish, Soy, Tree Nuts, Wheat; no artificial colors, flavors or preservatives (Fullscript label text). Contains pork-derived enzyme; NOT suitable for vegans or vegetarians.","sideEffects":"Not suitable for vegetarians, vegans or infants. If stools become harder to pass, you may be taking too much; reduce the dose or take a break. Consult a healthcare provider before giving supplements to children. Keep closed in a cool, dry place out of reach of children. Do not use if inner tamper seal is damaged."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Seeking Health''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Seeking Health":"https://www.seekinghealth.com/products/dao-enzyme"},"warnings":["Not suitable for vegetarians, vegans or infants.","If stools become harder to pass, you may be taking too much; reduce the dose or take a break.","Consult a healthcare provider before giving supplements to children.","Keep closed in a cool, dry place out of reach of children. Do not use if inner tamper seal is damaged."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.seekinghealth.com/products/dao-enzyme","what":"Brand page: name, price, variants, DAOgest source, pregnancy/breastfeeding suitability, directions, warnings, image"},{"url":"https://fullscript.com/catalog/products/histamine-block-60-caps","what":"Fullscript listing of Seeking Health DAO Enzyme: Supplement Facts text, other ingredients, free-of list, directions"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 1 capsule. DAOgest porcine kidney extract (Diamine Oxidase Activity 30,000 HDU) 4.2 mg. Other ingredients: microcrystalline cellulose, vegetarian capsule (hypromellose, water, and gellan gum), and ascorbyl palmitate. (Label text from Fullscript listing; brand page shows the panel only as an image and names DAOgest from porcine kidney.)","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Seeking Health''s product page:","steps":["Take 1 capsule no more than 15 minutes before histamine-rich foods, or as directed by your healthcare professional.","Brand page: as needed, take 1 capsule before eating or drinking, or away from food to support gut histamine levels.","Ages 4 and up may open the capsule and sprinkle it on a bite of applesauce or food."],"sourceUrl":"https://www.seekinghealth.com/products/dao-enzyme","sourceLabel":"Seeking Health: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: 30 capsules, 90 capsules."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-effective-nutra-dim-300-mg-with-bioperine', 'Effective Nutra DIM 300 mg with BioPerine', 'Effective Nutra', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A capsule with 300 mg DIM (diindolylmethane) and 5 mg BioPerine black pepper extract. The seller markets it for hormone balance, including menopause symptoms, PMS and hormonal acne in women. It is currently sold out on the brand site.', '$18.95 for 60 capsules, sold out on brand site (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://effective-nutra.com/cdn/shop/products/B07NCJH91H.GR.DIMSupplement300mg.MainImage.GP.jpg?v=1618608103', 'https://effective-nutra.com/products/dim', '["acne","pms","menopause","hormone-support","vegan","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["supplement","skin-hair","menopause"]'::jsonb, '["Effective Nutra"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","allergens":"Label record: 100% Vegan; Dairy Free; Soy Free; Allergens: None (NIH DSLD 266131). Brand page: Vegan, Non-GMO.","sideEffects":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Effective Nutra''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Effective Nutra":"https://effective-nutra.com/products/dim"},"warnings":["These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://effective-nutra.com/products/dim","what":"Brand page: price, sold-out status, 300 mg DIM + 5 mg BioPerine, marketing uses, image. Image filename includes B07NCJH91H, the sheet''s ASIN."},{"url":"https://api.ods.od.nih.gov/dsld/v9/label/266131","what":"NIH DSLD label record 266131 (entered 2022-02-23): Supplement Facts, other ingredients, free-of statements; no directions or warnings recorded"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 1 Vegetable Capsule; 60 servings. Diindolylmethane (DIM) 300 mg (DV not established); Bioperine (Black Pepper fruit extract) 5 mg (DV not established). Other ingredients: Vegetable Cellulose, Rice Flour, Silicon Dioxide, Magnesium Stearate. (From NIH Dietary Supplement Label Database record 266131; brand page shows the panel only as an image.)","hiddenReason":"Not every fact is sourced yet: Amazon listing could not be read (WebFetch: robots_disallowed), so the ASIN and amazonMatches are unverified. Brand image filename contains B07NCJH91H, which suggests it matches, but not verified.; Pregnancy, breastfeeding and medication warnings not on brand page or label record; Suggested use not on page; Sold out on brand site"}'::jsonb),
  ('p-micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder', 'Micro Ingredients Myo & D-Chiro Inositol Powder', 'Micro Ingredients', 'supplement', 'physical', 'An unflavored powder of myo-inositol and D-chiro inositol in a 40:1 ratio, mixed into a drink once a day. The brand markets it for women''s hormonal balance and ovarian support. The brand page does not mention PCOS.', '$34.95 for 1 lb (sale; regular $49.95), listed as sold out (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'http://www.microingredients.com/cdn/shop/files/Product-Shopify_d04c0387-c2cf-4699-96b1-8c5fde0d797c.jpg?v=1779303847', 'https://www.microingredients.com/products/micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder-1-pound', '["hormone-support","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Micro Ingredients"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements)","allergens":"Brand page: Non-GMO formula made without soy, dairy, gluten, fillers, preservatives, flavors, or tree nuts.","sideEffects":"Keep out of the reach of children. Keep in a cool dry place. If pregnant / lactating or taking any medications, consult your physician prior to use. Prop 65: risk of cancer and reproductive harm from exposure to lead (Vitacost listing)."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Micro Ingredients''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Micro Ingredients":"https://www.microingredients.com/products/micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder-1-pound"},"warnings":["Keep out of the reach of children.","Keep in a cool dry place.","If pregnant / lactating or taking any medications, consult your physician prior to use.","Prop 65: risk of cancer and reproductive harm from exposure to lead (Vitacost listing)."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.microingredients.com/products/micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder-1-pound","what":"Brand page: name, price, sizes, free-of line, directions, 40:1 ratio, image; Supplement Facts is image-only"},{"url":"https://www.vitacost.com/products/micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder-1-lb-454-g-156451","what":"Vitacost listing: Supplement Facts text, directions, warnings incl. pregnancy/lactation and Prop 65"}],"ingredients":"Serving size: 1 Scoop (2.05 g approx.); 221 servings (1 lb). Myo-Inositol 2,000 mg (DV not established); D-Chiro Inositol 50 mg (DV not established). No other ingredients. (Panel text from Vitacost listing; brand page meta confirms 2,000 mg myo-inositol with 50 mg D-chiro.)","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Micro Ingredients''s product page:","steps":["Adults take 1 scoop daily, mix with a non-carbonated beverage, and drink. Scoop included."],"sourceUrl":"https://www.microingredients.com/products/micro-ingredients-myo-d-chiro-inositol-powder-1-pound","sourceLabel":"Micro Ingredients: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: 1 lb (221 servings), 2 lb (442 servings)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-rif-care-organic-cotton-and-hemp-fiber-menstrual', 'Rif Care Organic Cotton and Hemp Fiber Menstrual Pads with Wings', 'Rif Care', 'pad', 'physical', 'Winged period pads with a 50/50 hemp and organic cotton top sheet and a plant-based backing. Regular is for moderate flow, Super is thicker for heavier flow, and the Long/Night pad has two sets of wings for heavy flow or overnight. The brand says they are made without SAP, PFAs, titanium dioxide, chlorine, bleach or plastic.', '$8.99 for 14 regular pads; $8.99 for 12 super; $8.99 for 10 overnight; 2-box packs $15.99 (brand pages, Nov 2026)', 'https://rifcare.com/cdn/shop/files/Rif_Care_hemp_fiber_period_pads_organic_clean_pads.jpg?v=1747891213', 'https://rifcare.com/products/menstrual-pads-regular-absorbency-with-wings', '["organic","sustainability","heavy-flow","comfort","leaks"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection","leak-protection"]'::jsonb, '["Rif Care"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The products may be listed under a contract manufacturer''s name, which these searches would not show.","materials":"Top sheet: 50/50 hemp and organic cotton. Core: air-laid paper and responsibly sourced pulp. Backing: plant-based, sugar-based, leak-proof. Wrapper: plant-based. Release paper: biodegradable. Overnight pad also infused with aloe vera leaf juice and lavender flower oil.","sideEffects":"Overnight pad contains aloe vera leaf juice and lavender flower oil (per page); no other warnings listed."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Rif Care''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Rif Care":"https://rifcare.com/products/menstrual-pads-regular-absorbency-with-wings"},"warnings":["Overnight pad contains aloe vera leaf juice and lavender flower oil (per page); no other warnings listed."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://rifcare.com/collections/all","what":"product list, URLs and starting prices (used to find the truncated pads link)"},{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/menstrual-pads-regular-absorbency-with-wings","what":"regular pad price, materials, size"},{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/hemp-pads-super-absorbency","what":"super pad price, materials, length"},{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/hemp-pads-overnight-organic-menstrual-pads-with-wings","what":"overnight pad price, materials incl. aloe and lavender oil, length"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=proprietary_name:\"Rif\"&limit=5","what":"openFDA: only unrelated results"}],"ingredients":"Top sheet: 50/50 hemp and organic cotton. Core: air-laid paper and responsibly sourced pulp. Backing: plant-based, sugar-based, leak-proof. Wrapper: plant-based. Release paper: biodegradable. Overnight pad also infused with aloe vera leaf juice and lavender flower oil.","optionsNote":"Options: Regular (9.4 in / 240 mm, 14 pads), Super (11.4 in / 290 mm, 12 pads), Long/Night (13 in / 330 mm, 10 pads)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-rif-care-organic-cotton-non-applicator-tampons', 'Rif Care Organic Cotton Non-Applicator Tampons', 'Rif Care', 'tampon', 'physical', 'Non-applicator tampons made of GOTS-certified organic cotton with a paper wrapper. The brand describes a patented organic cotton security veil meant to reduce fiber shedding. It says they are free of pesticides, bleach, fragrances, titanium dioxide and plastic.', '$7.99 for 18 tampons; $14 for 36; $20 for 54 (brand page, Nov 2026; regular page bundle list also shows 1 box at $7.69)', 'https://rifcare.com/cdn/shop/products/rifcareorganiccottontamponsaffordablehemofiber.png?v=1716006941', 'https://rifcare.com/products/organic-cotton-tampons', '["organic","sustainability","fragrance-free","heavy-flow"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection"]'::jsonb, '["Rif Care"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The products may be listed under a contract manufacturer''s name, which these searches would not show.","materials":"100% organic cotton core, 100% organic cotton security veil, 100% organic cotton string; paper wrapper.","sideEffects":"Wear for no more than 8 hours. Use the lowest absorbency for your flow. The page has no Toxic Shock Syndrome (TSS) warning."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Rif Care''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Rif Care":"https://rifcare.com/products/organic-cotton-tampons"},"warnings":["Wear for no more than 8 hours.","Use the lowest absorbency for your flow.","The page has no Toxic Shock Syndrome (TSS) warning."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/organic-cotton-tampons","what":"regular: price, materials, use, 8-hour limit"},{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/super-absorbency-organic-cotton-tampons","what":"super: price, materials, warnings"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=proprietary_name:\"Rif\"&limit=5","what":"openFDA: only unrelated results"}],"ingredients":"100% organic cotton core, 100% organic cotton security veil, 100% organic cotton string; paper wrapper.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Rif Care''s product page:","steps":["Insert with clean hands.","Can be used with a reusable applicator.","Choose the lowest absorbency that works for your flow.","Wear for no more than 8 hours."],"sourceUrl":"https://rifcare.com/products/organic-cotton-tampons","sourceLabel":"Rif Care: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Regular, Super."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-rif-care-organic-cotton-and-hemp-fiber-leakproof', 'Rif Care Organic Cotton and Hemp Fiber Leakproof Period Undies (no PFA added)', 'Rif Care', 'period-underwear', 'physical', 'Reusable mid-rise period underwear with a hemp and organic cotton body. The page says it gives up to 10 hours of protection and absorbs up to two regular tampons or pads of flow. The brand says it has no PFAs, SAP, titanium dioxide, chlorine or bleach.', '$29 per pair (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://rifcare.com/cdn/shop/products/rif_care_hemp_period_pads_and_tampons_val_emanuel_rebecca_caputo._7.jpg?v=1763256137', 'https://rifcare.com/products/period-leakproof-underwear-pfa-free', '["reusable","sustainability","organic","leaks","comfort"]'::jsonb, '["leak-protection","menstrual-collection"]'::jsonb, '["Rif Care"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The products may be listed under a contract manufacturer''s name, which these searches would not show.","materials":"Body and gusset: 28% hemp, 67% organic cotton, 5% spandex. Leakproof layer: 88% polyester, 12% nylon. Absorbent layer: ''PFA-Free absorbent layer'' (no fiber breakdown given)."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Rif Care''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Rif Care":"https://rifcare.com/products/period-leakproof-underwear-pfa-free"},"warnings":[],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://rifcare.com/products/period-leakproof-underwear-pfa-free","what":"price, sizes, materials, wear and care guidance"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=proprietary_name:\"Rif\"&limit=5","what":"openFDA: only unrelated results"}],"ingredients":"Body and gusset: 28% hemp, 67% organic cotton, 5% spandex. Leakproof layer: 88% polyester, 12% nylon. Absorbent layer: ''PFA-Free absorbent layer'' (no fiber breakdown given).","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Rif Care''s product page:","steps":["Light flow: all-day wear.","Moderate flow: up to 8 hours, or as backup with other products.","Heavy flow: up to 4 hours, or pair with pads, tampons or cups.","Wash cold in a lingerie bag with regular clothes, or hand wash; hang dry."],"sourceUrl":"https://rifcare.com/products/period-leakproof-underwear-pfa-free","sourceLabel":"Rif Care: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Sizes XS, S, M, L, XL, 2XL, 3XL, Packs of 1 to 5."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-viv-for-your-v-viv-disc', 'Viv for your V Viv Disc', 'Viv for your V', 'disc', 'physical', 'A reusable menstrual disc made of dark-colored medical-grade silicone, with a pull tab for removal. The brand calls it beginner-friendly and says it can be worn up to 12 hours, holds as much as 4 to 6 tampons, and can be reused for up to 10 years.', '$20 (brand page, Nov 2026); Disc Starter Kit $29', 'https://vivforyourv.com/cdn/shop/files/LDisc.png?v=1788896241', 'https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-menstrual-disc?variant=46778548191461', '["reusable","sustainability","cost","heavy-flow","comfort"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection","leak-protection"]'::jsonb, '["Viv for your V"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found for the disc itself (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The company, VIV FOR YOUR V, INC., is FDA-registered/listed for menstrual cups (product code HHE, Class 2) with no proprietary names, so openFDA does not show whether that listing covers the disc.","materials":"100% medical-grade silicone (dark-colored).","sideEffects":"Page lists no warnings (no TSS or IUD guidance)."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Viv for your V''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Viv for your V":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-menstrual-disc?variant=46778548191461"},"warnings":["Page lists no warnings (no TSS or IUD guidance)."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com","what":"brand home page product list and prices"},{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-menstrual-disc?variant=46778548191461","what":"disc price, sizes, material, use, wear time"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=registration.owner_operator.firm_name:\"VIV FOR YOUR V\"&limit=10","what":"3 listings: HEB, HHD, HHE"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/udi.json?search=brand_name:\"Viv\"&limit=10","what":"5 UDI records, no disc"}],"ingredients":"100% medical-grade silicone (dark-colored).","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Viv for your V''s product page:","steps":["Pinch the disc in the middle so it folds into a figure-8.","Guide the folded edge into the body.","To remove, loop a finger into the pull tab and guide the disc out.","Wear up to 12 hours at a time."],"sourceUrl":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-menstrual-disc?variant=46778548191461","sourceLabel":"Viv for your V: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Small/Med, Large."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-viv-for-your-v-viv-menstrual-cup', 'Viv for your V Viv Menstrual Cup', 'Viv for your V', 'cup', 'physical', 'A reusable menstrual cup made of medical-grade silicone with a ring stem for removal. The brand calls it beginner-friendly and says it can be worn up to 12 hours, holds as much as 4 super tampons, and can be reused for up to 10 years.', '$20 (brand page, Nov 2026); Cup Starter Kit $29; Cup Perfect Fit Kit $47', 'https://vivforyourv.com/cdn/shop/files/MCup.png?v=1788917764', 'https://vivforyourv.com/products/menstrual-cup?variant=44388758388965', '["reusable","sustainability","cost","comfort"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection","leak-protection"]'::jsonb, '["Viv for your V"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"FDA-registered/listed (product code HHE, Cup, Menstrual, Class 2), firm VIV FOR YOUR V, INC.; GUDID/UDI records for Viv Menstrual Cup Size 1 (Small) and Size 2 (Large).","materials":"100% medical-grade silicone.","sideEffects":"Page lists no warnings (no TSS or IUD guidance)."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Viv for your V''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Viv for your V":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/menstrual-cup?variant=44388758388965"},"warnings":["Page lists no warnings (no TSS or IUD guidance)."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com","what":"product list"},{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/menstrual-cup?variant=44388758388965","what":"price, sizes, material, wear time"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=registration.owner_operator.firm_name:\"VIV FOR YOUR V\"&limit=10","what":"HHE Class 2 listing"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/udi.json?search=brand_name:\"Viv\"&limit=10","what":"cup Size 1 and Size 2 records"}],"ingredients":"100% medical-grade silicone.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Viv for your V''s product page:","steps":["Wear up to 12 hours at a time (page links to a separate cup guide for steps)."],"sourceUrl":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/menstrual-cup?variant=44388758388965","sourceLabel":"Viv for your V: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: X Small, Small, Large."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-viv-for-your-v-viv-organic-cotton-tampons', 'Viv for your V Viv Organic Cotton Tampons', 'Viv for your V', 'tampon', 'physical', 'Applicator tampons with a 100% organic cotton core and veil, using the brand''s Cottonlock technology, which it says helps prevent fiber shedding. The page says they are unscented, dye-free, not made with chlorine-bleached cotton, and suitable for sensitive skin.', '$9 per box (brand page, Nov 2026); bundle $36', 'https://vivforyourv.com/cdn/shop/files/RegularTampons.png?v=1788900234', 'https://vivforyourv.com/products/tampons?variant=44153767002341', '["organic","fragrance-free","heavy-flow"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection"]'::jsonb, '["Viv for your V"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"FDA-registered/listed (product code HEB, Tampon, Menstrual, Unscented, Class 2); the firm''s listing references 510(k)-cleared K162746, which openFDA shows as held by Ontex Bvba (manufacturer), not Viv.","materials":"Absorbent core: 100% organic cotton. Security veil: 100% organic cotton. Withdrawal cord: organic cotton. Applicator: compact plastic made without BPA or phthalates. Wrapper: polyethylene.","sideEffects":"Page shows no TSS warning, wear time or use instructions."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Viv for your V''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Viv for your V":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/tampons?variant=44153767002341"},"warnings":["Page shows no TSS warning, wear time or use instructions."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/tampons?variant=44153767002341","what":"price, absorbencies, materials"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=registration.owner_operator.firm_name:\"VIV FOR YOUR V\"&limit=10","what":"HEB listing with K162746"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/510k.json?search=k_number:K162746","what":"510(k) held by Ontex Bvba, 2017"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/udi.json?search=brand_name:\"Viv\"&limit=10","what":"UDI records for Regular, Super, combo"}],"ingredients":"Absorbent core: 100% organic cotton. Security veil: 100% organic cotton. Withdrawal cord: organic cotton. Applicator: compact plastic made without BPA or phthalates. Wrapper: polyethylene.","optionsNote":"Options: Regular (18 count), Super (16 count), Combo (8 Regular + 8 Super)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-viv-for-your-v-viv-bamboo-pads-liners', 'Viv for your V Viv Bamboo Pads & Liners', 'Viv for your V', 'pad', 'physical', 'Disposable pads and liners made from bamboo and corn fiber with wood pulp, in a home-compostable wrapper. The brand says they are allergen-free, BPA-free, phthalate-free and 4 times more absorbent than traditional pads. Pads come as winged Day pads and longer double-winged Night pads.', 'Pads $8.50 for 12; liners $6.50 for 16 (brand pages, Nov 2026); Combo Box liners & pads $25.50', 'https://vivforyourv.com/cdn/shop/files/ShopPadsLiners.png?v=1788898938', 'https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-bamboo-pads-delivered-to-your-door?variant=45086501601509', '["sustainability","comfort","leaks","heavy-flow"]'::jsonb, '["menstrual-collection","leak-protection"]'::jsonb, '["Viv for your V"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"FDA-registered/listed (product code HHD, Pad, Menstrual, Unscented, Class 1), firm VIV FOR YOUR V, INC., no proprietary name on the listing.","materials":"Pad and liner: bamboo and corn fiber, wood pulp, Sumitomo SAP, corn starch-based PLA, PBAT, hot melt adhesive. Wrapper: certified home compostable corn starch-based PLA and PBAT."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Viv for your V''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Viv for your V":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-bamboo-pads-delivered-to-your-door?variant=45086501601509"},"warnings":[],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-bamboo-pads-delivered-to-your-door?variant=45086501601509","what":"pad price, variants, materials"},{"url":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/panty-liners-bamboo-based-biodegradable-sustainable-period-care?variant=45086509334757","what":"liner price, materials"},{"url":"https://api.fda.gov/device/registrationlisting.json?search=registration.owner_operator.firm_name:\"VIV FOR YOUR V\"&limit=10","what":"HHD Class 1 listing"}],"ingredients":"Pad and liner: bamboo and corn fiber, wood pulp, Sumitomo SAP, corn starch-based PLA, PBAT, hot melt adhesive. Wrapper: certified home compostable corn starch-based PLA and PBAT.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Viv for your V''s product page:","steps":["Put used pads and liners in the trash, not compost or recycling; wrappers can be composted."],"sourceUrl":"https://vivforyourv.com/products/viv-bamboo-pads-delivered-to-your-door?variant=45086501601509","sourceLabel":"Viv for your V: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Day pads (winged, 12), Night pads (double-winged, longer, 12), Combo (6 Day + 6 Night), Liners (16)."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-ferra-period-brownies', 'Ferra Period Brownies', 'Ferra', 'supplement', 'physical', 'Fudgy brownies that contain 6.0 mg of Ferrochel (ferrous bisglycinate, a chelated iron) per serving. The page says this form of iron is easier on digestion and absorbs better than ferrous sulfate.', '$24.99 (sale, regular $28; count not listed) (brand page, Nov 2026); pre-order, shown sold out, ships November', 'https://eatferra.com/cdn/shop/files/ObjectID31_15185539-4579-4b47-a98c-aeb9820f4a5b.png?v=1791989984', 'https://eatferra.com/products/period-brownies', '["anemia","fatigue","supplement"]'::jsonb, '["supplement"]'::jsonb, '["Ferra"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Food product with iron; not FDA-approved. Page carries the FDA disclaimer: ''These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.''","sideEffects":"No warnings listed. Health claim without a cited study: Ferrochel is ''clinically shown to be easier on digestion'' than standard iron."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Ferra''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Ferra":"https://eatferra.com/products/period-brownies"},"warnings":["No warnings listed. Health claim without a cited study: Ferrochel is ''clinically shown to be easier on digestion'' than standard iron."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://eatferra.com/products/period-brownies","what":"price, iron content, claims, disclaimer"}],"ingredients":"Only stated: ''6.0mg of Ferrochel® per serving'' (ferrous bisglycinate). Full ingredient list and nutrition facts not shown on the page.","hiddenReason":"Not every fact is sourced yet: Full ingredients and nutrition facts missing; Allergens missing (likely relevant for a baked food: wheat, egg, dairy unknown); Count per box missing; Pregnancy/breastfeeding not stated"}'::jsonb),
  ('p-popmask-big-hug-self-heating-patches', 'Popmask Big Hug Self-Heating Patches', 'Popmask', 'cramp-relief', 'physical', 'Air-activated heat patches that the brand says give up to 12 hours of steady heat for period cramps. They are thin and stick to clothing or underwear, not skin. The page lists iron powder, water, vermiculite, activated carbon and salt.', '$10.99 (count not stated) (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://us.popmasklondon.com/cdn/shop/files/NEW_MARCH2026_5HUG_White_Background.png?v=1774966821', 'https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/new-big-hug', '["cramps","drug-free","external-only","comfort"]'::jsonb, '["cramp-relief","comfort"]'::jsonb, '["Popmask"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026).","materials":"Iron powder, water, vermiculite, activated carbon, salt.","sideEffects":"Never apply directly on skin."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Popmask''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Popmask":"https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/new-big-hug"},"warnings":["Never apply directly on skin."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/new-big-hug","what":"price, ingredients, use, duration"}],"ingredients":"Iron powder, water, vermiculite, activated carbon, salt.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Popmask''s product page:","steps":["Open the pouch and peel off the backing.","Attach to clothing or underwear, never directly on skin.","Use on abdomen, back, neck, shoulders or knees.","Throw away after use, once cooled."],"sourceUrl":"https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/new-big-hug","sourceLabel":"Popmask: product page"}}'::jsonb),
  ('p-popmask-flash-me-hot-flash-cooling-spray-80ml', 'Popmask Flash Me Hot Flash Cooling Spray 80ml', 'Popmask', 'menopause', 'physical', 'A cucumber-scented face and body mist for sudden hot flashes and dry, dull skin. The page says to use it day or night on the face, neck and chest. It lists ceramides and hyaluronic acid as actives.', '$4.99 for 80 ml (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://us.popmasklondon.com/cdn/shop/products/J003310-BlushingLAFlashMe2.png?v=1683043271', 'https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/flash-me-hot-flash-cooling-spray-80ml', '["menopause","perimenopause","skin","vegan","cruelty-free"]'::jsonb, '["menopause","comfort","skin-hair"]'::jsonb, '["Popmask"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Cosmetic; not an FDA-regulated device as listed (no openFDA device query applicable).","materials":"Actives only, as listed: ''Ceremides'' (sic), hyaluronic acids. Full ingredient list not shown.","allergens":"Cucumber scent; no fragrance details given."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Popmask''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Popmask":"https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/flash-me-hot-flash-cooling-spray-80ml"},"warnings":[],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://us.popmasklondon.com/products/flash-me-hot-flash-cooling-spray-80ml","what":"price, size, actives, claims"}],"ingredients":"Actives only, as listed: ''Ceremides'' (sic), hyaluronic acids. Full ingredient list not shown.","hiddenReason":"Not every fact is sourced yet: Full ingredients list missing; No directions or warnings; Fragrance details missing (scented product; not fragrance-free); Pregnancy info missing"}'::jsonb),
  ('p-hoolest-verelief-prime', 'Hoolest VeRelief Prime', 'Hoolest', 'mental-health', 'physical', 'A handheld device that sends electrical pulses through gel tips pressed to the skin below the earlobe, which the brand says targets the vagus nerve. It has modes for worry, sleep, stress, focus and panic. The brand sells it for daily stress recovery and sleep preparation.', '$159 sale (regular $199), device only; bundle with 12 packs gel tips $319 (brand page, Nov 2026; shown sold out)', 'https://hoolest.com/cdn/shop/files/verelief-prime-4846318.jpg?v=1784286251', 'https://hoolest.com/products/verelief-prime-1', '["stress","sleep","drug-free","wearable"]'::jsonb, '["mental-health","sleep"]'::jsonb, '["Hoolest"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The brand says its products are ''low-risk, general wellness products that do not require FDA regulation.''","materials":"Device plus 2 pairs of gel tips (materials not listed).","sideEffects":"Not for people with metal implants in the head or neck, extremely sensitive skin, extreme reactivity to stimuli, or chronic neurological conditions (per page). Page says it is not intended for Long COVID, chronic fatigue, brain fog, vertigo, dysautonomia/POTS, tinnitus or nervous system hypersensitivity. Consult a healthcare provider first if managing chronic illness."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Hoolest''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Hoolest":"https://hoolest.com/products/verelief-prime-1"},"warnings":["Not for people with metal implants in the head or neck, extremely sensitive skin, extreme reactivity to stimuli, or chronic neurological conditions (per page).","Page says it is not intended for Long COVID, chronic fatigue, brain fog, vertigo, dysautonomia/POTS, tinnitus or nervous system hypersensitivity.","Consult a healthcare provider first if managing chronic illness."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://hoolest.com","what":"product list, prices, FDA wellness statement"},{"url":"https://hoolest.com/products/verelief-prime-1","what":"price, use, modes, warnings"}],"ingredients":"Device plus 2 pairs of gel tips (materials not listed).","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Hoolest''s product page:","steps":["Remove the cap to expose the gel tips.","Press the tips to the skin below the earlobe.","Hold for at least 30 seconds; the page suggests 1 to 5 minutes per side.","For daily use the page suggests twice a day (morning and before bed) for 2 to 3 weeks, then tapering."],"sourceUrl":"https://hoolest.com/products/verelief-prime-1","sourceLabel":"Hoolest: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Device only, Bundle with gel tips."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-queen-of-the-thrones-ritual-starter-liver-castor', 'Queen of the Thrones Ritual Starter - Liver Castor Oil Pack Kit', 'Queen of the Thrones', 'intimate-care', 'physical', 'A kit with a reusable strap-on cotton pack for the upper right abdomen and a 500 mL bottle of organic cold-pressed castor oil. The brand markets it as a self-care tool that gives a calming sensation and says no heat is needed. None of the page''s health claims cite a study.', '$71.97 sale (regular $87.44): one liver pack + 500 mL castor oil (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://queenofthethrones.com/cdn/shop/files/QOTT_LiverCOP-Oil_KIT_Model-Box_1.png?v=1761336503', 'https://queenofthethrones.com/collections/castor-oil-kits-made-just-for-you/products/castor-oil-pack-and-500ml-oil-bundle', '["herbal","organic","drug-free","external-only","reusable"]'::jsonb, '["comfort"]'::jsonb, '["Queen of the Thrones"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Not an FDA-regulated device as listed (topical castor oil and fabric pack). No FDA disclaimer on page.","materials":"Oil: Organic Golden Castor Oil, cold-pressed, 100% pure, extra virgin, hexane-free (USDA Organic, Non-GMO Project Verified). Pack: inner 100% unbleached organic cotton, outer 100% polypropylene, straps 100% nylon.","sideEffects":"For topical use only; not for ingestion. Avoid during pregnancy. Unsupported health claims (no study cited): ''Energize your liver area''; ''help you relax naturally''; supports ''each stage of a woman''s life'' incl. fertility and menopause; improves look of stretch marks, fine lines and wrinkles; plastic bottles ''may leach hormone-disrupting compounds''; oil alone gives ''about 50% of the benefits''."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Queen of the Thrones''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Queen of the Thrones":"https://queenofthethrones.com/collections/castor-oil-kits-made-just-for-you/products/castor-oil-pack-and-500ml-oil-bundle"},"warnings":["For topical use only; not for ingestion.","Avoid during pregnancy.","Unsupported health claims (no study cited): ''Energize your liver area''; ''help you relax naturally''; supports ''each stage of a woman''s life'' incl. fertility and menopause; improves look of stretch marks, fine lines and wrinkles; plastic bottles ''may leach hormone-disrupting compounds''; oil alone gives ''about 50% of the benefits''."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://queenofthethrones.com","what":"brand product list"},{"url":"https://queenofthethrones.com/collections/castor-oil-kits-made-just-for-you","what":"all kits and prices"},{"url":"https://queenofthethrones.com/collections/castor-oil-kits-made-just-for-you/products/castor-oil-pack-and-500ml-oil-bundle","what":"contents, materials, use, warnings, claims"}],"ingredients":"Oil: Organic Golden Castor Oil, cold-pressed, 100% pure, extra virgin, hexane-free (USDA Organic, Non-GMO Project Verified). Pack: inner 100% unbleached organic cotton, outer 100% polypropylene, straps 100% nylon.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Queen of the Thrones''s product page:","steps":["Pour 1 to 2 tbsp of oil onto the soft side of the pack and spread evenly.","Place over the right upper abdomen below the ribcage and adjust the straps.","Wear at least 1 hour or overnight; no added heat needed.","Page FAQ: start with 7 days in a row, then 3 to 5 times a week. Replace the pack after about 60 uses."],"sourceUrl":"https://queenofthethrones.com/collections/castor-oil-kits-made-just-for-you/products/castor-oil-pack-and-500ml-oil-bundle","sourceLabel":"Queen of the Thrones: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Liver kit (this entry), Pelvic Castor Oil Pack Kit $74.97."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-cean-lymphatic-maternity-compression-romper', 'CEAN Lymphatic Maternity Compression Romper', 'CEAN', 'pregnancy', 'physical', 'A seamless maternity romper with graduated compression through the legs and a non-compressive, expanding belly panel. The brand says it supports circulation and lymphatic flow and reduces puffiness. It is sized by hip measurement and meant to feel firmer than activewear but not like shapewear.', '$188 (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://cean.com/cdn/shop/files/lymphatic-maternity-compression-romper-4262623.png?v=1787158688&width=1080', 'https://cean.com/en-us/products/lymphatic-maternity-romper', '["pregnancy","comfort","postpartum"]'::jsonb, '["comfort"]'::jsonb, '["CEAN"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"No FDA listing found (checked openFDA Nov 2, 2026). The site says its products are general wellness items and its claims have not been evaluated by the FDA.","materials":"70% Micro Modal, 18% Nylon, 12% Elastane (site-wide materials section); OEKO-TEX certified fibers per page.","sideEffects":"Consult a doctor before use if you have pre-existing conditions (site disclaimer). Claims of improved circulation, lymphatic flow and reduced puffiness cite ''clinical studies and peer-reviewed research'' but no specific study."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are CEAN''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"CEAN":"https://cean.com/en-us/products/lymphatic-maternity-romper"},"warnings":["Consult a doctor before use if you have pre-existing conditions (site disclaimer).","Claims of improved circulation, lymphatic flow and reduced puffiness cite ''clinical studies and peer-reviewed research'' but no specific study."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://cean.com/en-us/products/lymphatic-maternity-romper","what":"price, sizes, colors, materials, claims, disclaimer"}],"ingredients":"70% Micro Modal, 18% Nylon, 12% Elastane (site-wide materials section); OEKO-TEX certified fibers per page.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per CEAN''s product page:","steps":["Size by hip measurement; size up if between sizes."],"sourceUrl":"https://cean.com/en-us/products/lymphatic-maternity-romper","sourceLabel":"CEAN: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Sizes C1 (3XS/2XS) to C4 (XL/2XL), Colors: Black, Royal Navy, Double Espresso."}'::jsonb),
  ('p-pore-favor-acne-supplement', 'Pore Favor Acne Supplement', 'Pore Favor', 'supplement', 'physical', 'A capsule supplement the brand sells for acne, for both men and women. The page says it ''supports healthy hormone balance and oil regulation from within'' and offers a 90-day money-back guarantee.', '$49 (count not stated) (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://www.porefavor.com/cdn/shop/files/AcneSupplementHeroShopify_695d5600-8bc8-4998-85a1-14eb77388dc7.png?v=1788364863', 'https://www.porefavor.com/en-us/products/clear-skin-supplement', '["acne","supplement","skin","hormone-support"]'::jsonb, '["supplement","skin-hair"]'::jsonb, '["Pore Favor"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Dietary supplement; not FDA-approved (FDA does not approve supplements).","sideEffects":"Under 18s should seek medical advice before taking. Unsupported health claims (no study cited): ''TREATS THE ROOT CAUSE OF ACNE''; ''Interrupts pimple formation''; ''Balances sebum production''; ''supports healthy hormone balance''; 74% ''complete reduction in breakouts'' from a customer survey of 1,112 people; ''science-backed''. Note: ''treats'' wording conflicts with the page''s own FDA disclaimer."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Pore Favor''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, false, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Pore Favor":"https://www.porefavor.com/en-us/products/clear-skin-supplement"},"warnings":["Under 18s should seek medical advice before taking.","Unsupported health claims (no study cited): ''TREATS THE ROOT CAUSE OF ACNE''; ''Interrupts pimple formation''; ''Balances sebum production''; ''supports healthy hormone balance''; 74% ''complete reduction in breakouts'' from a customer survey of 1,112 people; ''science-backed''. Note: ''treats'' wording conflicts with the page''s own FDA disclaimer."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.porefavor.com/en-us/products/clear-skin-supplement","what":"price, claims, under-18 warning, FDA disclaimer"}],"hiddenReason":"Not every fact is sourced yet: Ingredients and amounts missing: only in an image (https://www.porefavor.com/cdn/shop/files/the-acne-supplement-706215.webp?v=1732724399) that could not be read; No directions (only customer reviews mention 2 capsules a day); Capsule count missing; Pregnancy, breastfeeding, allergen and medication info missing"}'::jsonb),
  ('p-topicals-faded-brightening-clearing-serum-unscen', 'Topicals Faded Brightening + Clearing Serum (Unscented)', 'Topicals', 'skincare', 'physical', 'A daily face serum for dark spots, discoloration, post-breakout marks and uneven tone. Key actives are tranexamic acid, niacinamide, azelaic acid, kojic acid and melatonin. The page says it suits all skin types and the new formula is odorless.', '$28 for 30 ml / 1 fl oz (brand page, Nov 2026)', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0503/2932/1627/files/251009_TOPICALS_Website_Faded_Unscented_Ppage_1.jpg?v=1761780749', 'https://www.mytopicals.com/products/faded', '["hyperpigmentation","acne","skin","vegan","cruelty-free"]'::jsonb, '["skin-hair"]'::jsonb, '["Topicals"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Cosmetic; not an FDA-regulated device as listed (no openFDA device query applicable).","materials":"Key actives (no percentages given): tranexamic acid, niacinamide, azelaic acid, kojic acid, melatonin. Full list is behind a link not read.","sideEffects":"Patch test first. Do not layer with AHAs, BHAs or retinoids. ''Clinically proven'' claim has no cited study; consumer-study figures (92% saw improvement after 2 weeks) are not described."}'::jsonb, null, null, null, 'brand', 'Product details are Topicals''s own, from its product page (read Nov 2026). Regulatory status checked in openFDA where it applies.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"whereToBuyLinks":{"Topicals":"https://www.mytopicals.com/products/faded"},"warnings":["Patch test first.","Do not layer with AHAs, BHAs or retinoids.","''Clinically proven'' claim has no cited study; consumer-study figures (92% saw improvement after 2 weeks) are not described."],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"addedFrom":"founder sheet, Nov 2 2026 (Ameera)","researchSources":[{"url":"https://www.mytopicals.com/products/faded","what":"price, actives, use, warnings, claims"}],"ingredients":"Key actives (no percentages given): tranexamic acid, niacinamide, azelaic acid, kojic acid, melatonin. Full list is behind a link not read.","howToUse":{"intro":"Per Topicals''s product page:","steps":["Apply all over 1 to 2 times a day after cleansing.","Follow with SPF in the daytime.","Do not layer directly with AHAs, BHAs or retinoids.","Patch test before use."],"sourceUrl":"https://www.mytopicals.com/products/faded","sourceLabel":"Topicals: product page"},"optionsNote":"Options: Full Size 30 ml, Jumbo, Mini, Trial Size."}'::jsonb)
